WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.669
So I got a ton of tweets over the weekend
that were asking me, Hey David, are you going

00:00:04.669 --> 00:00:06.079
to be at the straight pride,

00:00:06.079 --> 00:00:08.360
her aide in Boston this weekend?

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.360
It's happening.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.360
You should be there.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.360
You should interview people.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:15.660
You should counter protest or whatever because
you live in Boston anyway.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.300
And No, I didn't go for safety reasons because
I didn't want to give it any attention.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.890
I ended up actually being out of the city
anyway as I as I often am both during the

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.520
weekend and after the, uh, during the weekend.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.080
But this is not an event that appealed to
me.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.880
Um, the event happened.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.520
There were straight pride paraders.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:37.110
There were counter protesters actually more
counter protestors than paraders.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:38.810
There was a massive police presence.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:44.330
My contacts in law enforcement and the Intel
community told me that they were really busy

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.540
managing all of the different threats and
extremist groups that were expected to come

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.540
in.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:54.760
Um, there were more people protesting the
parade, then people marching for straight

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:55.760
pride.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:59.460
In total there were about 35 or 36 arrests
in total.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:05.750
I don't know what percentage of those arrests
were marchers versus counter protesters.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:09.460
I'm guessing at some point soon we will have
that information.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:13.100
The markers definitely had some themes in
their messages.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:17.180
Support our troops was a theme, build the
wall, was a theme.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.180
Great.

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.270
To be straight is a theme.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:21.170
A lot of pro Trump stuff.

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:23.750
Just make America great again in this type
of thing.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:28.979
Some people were hurt, nine people ended up
at area hospitals, so people here already

00:01:28.979 --> 00:01:31.310
know my feelings about this type of parade.

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:37.299
In general, a straight pride parade is unnecessary
in the sense that it's not just, if you have

00:01:37.299 --> 00:01:41.420
a gay pride parade, then obviously everything's
fine and you should have a straight pride

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:42.420
parade.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:48.619
The idea behind a gay pride parade is that
we're talking about a historically marginalized

00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:52.310
and discriminated against group who's placed
in society.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:59.319
A good people want to affirm most people or
straight people don't get fired for being

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:01.319
straight straight.

00:02:01.319 --> 00:02:05.540
People have always been able to get married
to those to whom they are attracted.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:08.720
I don't even want to dignify that part any
further.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:15.500
The idea of, you know, a white pride group,
a white student union or whatever as the same

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.480
thing as a Latino student union.

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:21.420
Well, you're not talking about a historically
marginalized and oppressed group and we have

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:24.840
to really examine what the motivations are
of a lot of those groups and the motivations

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:25.840
aren't good.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.920
Okay, so that that's where we're going to
stop with that analysis because it's such

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:32.610
a stupid analysis that it doesn't even need
to be done.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.550
One reason I didn't go is I don't want to
give them attention.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:42.060
I think counter protesting is totally valid,
but they aren't really marching for straight

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.250
pride.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.690
They are marching to anger people.

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:51.140
They are marching to trigger and own the libs
as they like to say, and some of them are

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.870
marching because they genuinely struggle with
their masculinity, but that's a whole other

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:57.570
story which we're not going to talk about
today.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:03.720
Very few of them actually show up to this
stuff to really protest and again, there were

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.950
more counter protesters this time around.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.930
What would happen if nobody showed up to counter
protest and however many people, I don't even

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.230
know how many marchers there were.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:14.400
Was it a few dozen was at a hundred people,
a couple, I don't know.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.180
Imagine if no one gave them any attention.

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:20.810
They show up, they march around with their
mega hats and they're build the wall signs

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:22.430
and they're totally ignored.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.170
No one protests, no one cares.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:28.000
No one tries to fight the permit for the parade.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.710
They are just ignored.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.150
No one writes about it.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.300
They are irrelevant.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:36.030
I think that that actually is a really great
scenario.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:41.550
Now again, I was out of town anyway and there
were all sorts of security concerns in terms

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:46.090
of some of the extremist groups that were
coming in, but these are just small groups

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.760
of people doing really dumb things.

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.350
What if we did just ignore them?

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.230
Now other perspectives are valid.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:56.670
When when Bernie Sanders chose to do a Fox
News town hall, the idea being I'm going to

00:03:56.670 --> 00:04:00.710
go right in there and talk directly to people
who might be on the right and maybe I can

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:04.440
convince them and Elizabeth Warren said, I'm
not going to participate at all because I

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.580
don't want to dignify.

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:10.470
In some sense a hate for profit Fox News and
give them ratings.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.020
Both of those perspectives are valid.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:16.780
I respect what Elizabeth Warren did and I
think Bernie Sanders crushed it in his debate,

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:19.189
but both are valid approaches.

00:04:19.189 --> 00:04:25.750
In the same way you can take the perspective
that a large showing of peace and love by

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:30.840
counter protesters at the straight pride parade
is the best way to fight against the message

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.379
of the straight pride parade.

00:04:32.379 --> 00:04:33.379
That's fine.

00:04:33.379 --> 00:04:37.490
I opted for a different path and I wonder
if every time they tried to organize one of

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.639
these, they just get the permit and nobody
cares.

00:04:40.639 --> 00:04:42.289
People go and do other things.

00:04:42.289 --> 00:04:44.550
They go to the music, great museums in Boston.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:48.200
They go to all of the different great things
that there are to do in Boston and they just

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.060
don't give any attention to these people.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.889
Would they keep doing these parades?

00:04:51.889 --> 00:04:54.010
Something tells me that they probably would
not.

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:58.940
They would not be doing this if no one paid
attention because the whole point of it is

00:04:58.940 --> 00:04:59.940
to get attention.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:00.940
So I didn't go.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:01.940
I wasn't there.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.999
I was out of the city in any case, but I would
not have gone if I was in town.

00:05:03.999 --> 00:05:04.360
To be totally honest with you.

